      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait really? i thought most people could take it if it's just a normal headache. i feel like i can't even function right now with the pain. is there like a specific dose that's okay or is it just totally off limits no matter what? i don't really have a doctor lined up yet since it's so early.",
