      "content": "ugh okay i get it. but i'm honestly so stressed and the pain is making me feel nauseous too. i really can't wait for an appointment or an urgent care visit right now. what about acetaminophen? is tylenol totally fine to take for a headache during the first trimester? like can i just take a couple of 500mg pills to get through the afternoon?",
